## 2. PROJECT OVERVIEW

### Project Name
GovAI Nexus

### Project Title
AI-Powered GovTech and Digital Governance Platform

### Tagline
Smarter Government. Faster Services. Transparent Governance.

### Project Vision

Develop a unified, intelligent, multilingual digital governance ecosystem that connects citizens, government employees, departments, administrators and public services through modern web and mobile applications.

The platform should use Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Generative AI, Retrieval-Augmented Generation, Natural Language Processing, Intelligent Document Processing, Predictive Analytics and Workflow Automation to improve government service delivery.

