## 3. PROJECT DEVELOPMENT STRATEGY

The complete project will be developed in six major phases.

### Phase 1 – Project Foundation & Architecture
Current phase. Establish architecture, requirements, technical decisions, database design, API contracts, codebase organization and documentation.

### Phase 2 – Complete UI/UX Design
Design the complete public website, portals, dashboards, mobile interfaces, components, design system and interactive prototypes. No backend implementation in this phase.

### Phase 3 – Full-Stack Core Platform Development
Develop frontend, backend, database, authentication, portals, government services, schemes, applications, document workflows and complaint management.

### Phase 4 – AI, ML, GenAI & Intelligent Automation
Develop RAG, LLM integrations, multilingual assistant, OCR, NLP, machine learning, prediction, fraud intelligence and multi-agent automation.

### Phase 5 – Advanced Governance, Analytics & Mobile Ecosystem
Develop advanced analytics, transparency, open data, infrastructure monitoring, mobile applications, external integrations and enterprise features.

### Phase 6 – Enterprise Testing, Security & Deployment
Perform complete testing, security assessment, performance optimization, deployment, monitoring and production readiness.

**Critical instruction:** Work exclusively on Phase 1 now. Prepare the foundation for all six phases, but do not implement the later phases.

